      "notes": "Provider plan/validate/apply backend operation. The shared operation dialog supplies its SQL tab. Draft pending front-end family rendering and presentation acceptance; no legacy form or panel is introduced. Stable SR-F allocation remains with the front-end registry owner. Owner Decision10: user-key results are metadata-only for beta (type and byte length); raw-key retrieval/export is outside this beta scope. No key material is returned in public plans, receipts or downloads."
